Exercise 3







Live exercise


For each program, find:

n_short: how many students sleep under 6 hours
prop_short: the proportion of students who sleep under 6 hours
prop_early: the proportion who have an early class (has_early_class == "Yes")
any_high: whether any student has avg_grade of 95 or above















survey |&gt;
  filter(!is.na(sleep_hours),!is.na(has_early_class),!is.na(avg_grade)) |&gt;
  group_by(program) |&gt;
  summarize(
    n_short = sum(sleep_hours &lt; 6),
    prop_short = mean(sleep_hours &lt; 6),
    prop_early = mean(has_early_class == "Yes"),
    any_high = any(avg_grade &gt;= 95)
  )
